ype":"paragraph","text":"色は黒かベージュやけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒かな～ヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構、甘々なワンピースとか好きやから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アウターは大人っぽくしなな～って感じよ～ヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、Aラインのも可愛く見える(°_°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レストローズのコートがめっちゃ欲しいけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我慢（；＿；）もっと大人なったら買うねん！（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のおでこがみたいですか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でこりんごちゃんですか、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなかデコだししやんので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真がないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今撮りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2013/11/05/7832412/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだが仏頂面なのもご愛嬌ってかヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のおでこのやる気スイッチさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごきげんよう( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.衣装のお気に入りＴＯＰ３は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんですか！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.お気に入りの３つは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルールの制服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れバイシクルの制服です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは、何が好きなん？(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.文化祭シーズンですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんは文化祭の思い出ありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.昔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラスのデザート係になって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"杏仁豆腐を販売しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達と一生懸命作って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事、杏仁豆腐は完売しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、その杏仁豆腐は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く杏仁の味もしない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豆腐でもない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ不味いドロドロの液体やったらしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にあの時は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ない気持ちでいっぱいになりました（；＿；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※人体に影響はありませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村は説明書通りに作りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.さゆりんはマックとか行きますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.マックには行かん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっちゅんはマクドや！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マックとか言うて都会ぶってんちゃうぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日からマクドはマクド！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミスドはミスドに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"統一やーーー( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※個人の意見です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.早稲田のファッション企画に参加した６人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","